{"ref":"BDB, חֹ֫רֶב","hw":"חֹ֫רֶב","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹ֫רֶב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:40\" href=\"/Genesis.31.40\">Gn 31:40</a></sup> <strong>dryness, drought, heat</strong>, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:40\" href=\"/Genesis.31.40\">Gn 31:40</a> + 11 times + <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.22\">Dt 28:22</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶב</span>; v. Di, sq. 𝔙; 𝔊 and 𝔊L om.);—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>dryness</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:37\" href=\"/Judges.6.37\">Ju 6:37</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:39\" href=\"/Judges.6.39\">39</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 6:40\" href=\"/Judges.6.40\">40</a> (all of absence of dew); <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:38\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.38\">Je 50:38</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יָבֵשׁ</span>); so read also <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:17\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.17\">Zc 11:17</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">חֶרֶב</span>, see v b and Sta<sup>ZAW i. 1881, 29</sup>), <em>a drying up upon his arm</em> (i. e. a <em>withering</em>) <em>and upon his right eye</em>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>drought</em> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:11\" href=\"/Haggai.1.11\">Hg 1:11</a> + <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 28:22\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.28.22\">Dt 28:22</a> v. supr.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>parching heat</em> (of sun) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:40\" href=\"/Genesis.31.40\">Gn 31:40</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫רַח</span>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 36:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.36.30\">Je 36:30</a> (opp. <em>id.</em>); <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.6\">Is 4:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.4\">25:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 25:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.25.5\">5</a><sup>(×2)</sup> of fever <a data-ref=\"Job 30:30\" href=\"/Job.30.30\">Jb 30:30</a>.","next":"BDB, חָֽרָבָה","prev":"BDB, חָרֵב²"}